  "analysis_md": "$\\dfrac{z-1}{z+1}=\\dfrac{(z-1)(\\bar z+1)}{|z+1|^2}=\\dfrac{|z|^2+z-\\bar z-1}{|z+1|^2}=\\dfrac{x^2+y^2-1+2yi}{(x+1)^2+y^2}$。",
